  "source_findings": [
    "The source obtains n from io/argument-u64(1), constructs dynamic indices 0..n and declares coefficient(i,j). There is no fixed n=5500 in the source.",
    "A is declared as a nested coefficient comprehension, but the retained generated constant table contains function code, parameters and capture placeholders; no numeric matrix array or answer is embedded.",
    "The retained step function code captures matrix-temp-columns-4 and matrix-temp-rows-3 as Integer slots. The coefficient function accepts i,j and has zero captures. Thus a source-level reference to A is represented by code plus dimensions rather than a hidden fully populated matrix.",
    "The generated Rust main parses the constant table, creates a Context and calls the compiled mech_sequence_entry. Its build script links mech-sequence.o; the retained build command explicitly selects the Cranelift backend.",
    "The retained work audit specifies 20 power applications, 40 matrix-vector products and 1,210,000,000 weighted contributions for n=5500, with coefficients computed by emitted Mech arithmetic and no stored matrix.",
    "Current matched control source/binary identities exactly equal the retained four-function build identities. Control row runtime_environment is empty; the common sampler supplies its common environment (including RAYON_NUM_THREADS=8). Profile-name suffixes are not used here as proof of a fresh runtime environment override."
  ],
